 "insight": [
  "The trend of import concentration by partner countries in Luxembourg from 2005 to 2025 shows increases for Belgium, Germany, and France, and a decrease for China.",
  "Imports from Germany increased by 69.9 %, from 3.69 billion euros in 2005 to 6.27 billion euros in 2025, making it a key partner.",
  "China's imports decreased by 66.1 %, from 2.25 billion euros in 2005 to 761.3 million euros in 2025, with a peak in 2008 at 4.07 billion euros.",
  "Belgium's imports peaked in 2022 at 8.10 billion euros, higher than the 7.54 billion euros in 2025, showing some recent fluctuation.",
  "Values are in current euros and include 3.7 % from undisclosed partners, which are not ranked separately."
 ],
